966_7216966660408626414_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lpAFXNOV3H4Q7kNvwGNLPUG&_nc_oc=Adlo22T6UsqrhNbSLLMWnzSqFmDX2m6J8ASbmWekW6Yrqn1X7ObMQG9Vf0NqCpXuFyI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw0MVGKBI-Dn6pSKRUYazLo2lZQadgd7ctj3lEGifIdLQ&oe=69AAB728"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover.png", "id": "1116681196788883", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982477_1116681200122216_6236613464184975156_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jR52mFPVwiYQ7kNvwGPR2r6&_nc_oc=AdkkRW-ph2yhiR2HIMie1lurrZQ-znS6Yzf9B8kx_EVRt1BjFWsLEqXsgyje_ITrg_w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxldMLyrBwsWrrr8MNJ4R-M6iRohda9BGaE0SD4Cn3LuA&oe=69AAD396"}, "display_name": "SprintAR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "SprintAR is an Augmented Reality training app.\n\nIt lays out different patterns of training cones for sprinting, football, soccer or basketball. Automatically records lap times and shows a **ghost replay for you to chase!**\n\n- Never measure out training cones (witches hats) ever again!\n- Never have to collect them back up again, either :)\n- Includes many different cone patterns (no need to research them)\n\n# For personal trainers and coaches\n\n- Impress students with the latest technology\n- When running, students see a guide where to go next\n- Forces students to go round cones properly\n- Optionally use soccer balls or basketballs\n- Designed to quickly hand off the headset from one student to the next\n\n# For students\n\n- Chase a ghost of the best time!\n- See your time instantly\n- Practice multiple patterns, in the same space, with no setup time\n\n**SAFETY WARNING: never expose the inside of your VR headset (where the lenses are) to direct sunlight**\n", "short_description": "Layout different patterns of training cones in Augmented Reality. Automatically record lap times and show a ghost replay for you to chase!"}]}, "develope